sic.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 61.623, "end": 63.003, "text": "Y con el 45, Pólviz.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 63.023, "end": 68.405, "text": "Sus dentes, 1, 37, Preston.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 68.425, "end": 69.425, "text": "Con el 40, Uwe.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 69.565, "end": 69.925, "text": "1, 3, Peter King.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 70.086, "end": 71.366, "text": "Con el 8, Oetschka.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 71.918, "end": 72.198, "text": " 9-10, Musiala.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 72.218, "end": 73.119, "text": "Con el 11, Jackson.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 73.139, "end": 76.581, "text": "9-19, Davis.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 77.021, "end": 82.084, "text": "Con el 20, Bislot.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 82.445, "end": 84.986, "text": "9-21, Hito.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 85.367, "end": 98.095, "text": "Con el 22, Carreiro.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 98.115, "end": 98.535, "text": "Y con el 1-42, Calvo.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 98.555, "end": 99.175, "text": "El creador, Vincent Lombardi.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 99.195, "end": 100.936, "text": "Y por el regalo del club de fútbol...", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 103.298, "end": 103.878, "text": " Número 13, Andréi.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 103.978, "end": 110.762, "text": "Número 12, Trent Alexander.", "speaker_id": null, "flags": []}, {"start": 110.842, "end": 111.602, "text": "Número 22, Antonio.", "speaker_id": null, "flags": []}, {"start": 111.622, "end": 117.045, "text": "Número 24, Filipe.", "speaker_id": null, "flags": []}, {"start": 117.065, "end": 132.612, "t